    "title": "Lewiston opens new fire station - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Spectrum News Staff ,\n12 hours ago LEWISTON –– The Lewiston Fire Department opened its newest station Wednesday, replacing a building that was too small and too old for modern firefighting. The new station is located at 9 Captain Bazinet Way, a new street named after the first Lewiston firefighter to die in the line of duty. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
